      "content": "can u give me a more specific example of that? like, when it comes to managing acute pain in an ER setting, is there any actual clinical basis for the idea that certain racial groups have a higher tolerance or need different dosages? i heard it mentioned in a lecture once as a \"clinical pattern\" but i wasn't sure if that was actually based on science or just outdated stuff.",
